<br/>
<br/>
<b>IMPORTANT:</b> The gear recommendations below are simply that; recommendations. With the addition of reforging in Cataclysm, you will often have to change around pieces of gear in order to fix stat caps, such as balancing hit and expertise caps. You will often find that certain pieces may not have a role until another piece is obtained. As a general rule, higher item level pieces will almost always win out - remember that extra hit and expertise can be replaced, but Strength <i>cannot</i> be reforged into.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Fury Warrior DPS</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-fury-warrior-dps">Head for Fury Warrior DPS</h4>With the new Inferno Rune Dungeons, our best helmet is now the T13 helm we can acquire from the new currency.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62368/arcanum-of-the-dragonmaw">
