<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Fury Warrior DPS</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-fury-warrior-dps">Weapons for Fury Warrior DPS</h4>In Previous phases, Titan's Grip focused builds fell behind <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=81099/single-minded-fury">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/warrior_talent_icon_singlemindedfury.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Single-Minded Fury</span></a> focused builds, largely due to the strength of certain abilities and the comparitively stronger 1 Handed Weapons. However, with the introduction of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78487/gurthalak-voice-of-the-deeps">
<img alt="Gurthalak, Voice of the Deeps" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_2h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gurthalak, Voice of the Deeps</span></a>, this is no longer the case. Even in pre-raid, these weapons outscale every other 1 hand weapon build in the game, including Heroic Deathwing weapons. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74246/enchant-weapon-landslide">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Landslide</span></a>
